title: "Comparative Evaluation of Deep Learning and NLMS Adaptive Filtering for ECG Denoising in Resource Constrained Environments"
abstract: "This study presents a comparative evaluation of two distinct approaches to ECG signal denoising: Normalized Least Mean Squares (NLMS) adaptive filtering and a lightweight Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)."
